-- Q1287: Individual Taxation: Deductions [medium/L3]
UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["Both taxpayers deduct the $3,800 in auto loan interest because the deduction applies to all vehicle purchases regardless of origin","Harper may deduct the $3,800 as an above-the-line deduction because the vehicle meets the U.S.-manufactured requirement; Jensen may not","Jensen deducts the interest while Harper does not, because the deduction is designed to encourage purchasing of imported vehicles","Both deduct the interest, but Harper receives a double deduction as an additional incentive for buying a domestic vehicle"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
